    "A calm, native home for your coding agents." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为你的编程智能体打造的清爽原生空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A card with the turn's progress bar, or a plain line" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以带进度条的卡片或简洁的单行形式显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A careful lead and a wide, fast team: Opus writes the briefs, six Gemini Flash heads sprint through them." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "谨慎的主导加上阵容庞大、行动迅速的团队：Opus 撰写任务简报，六个 Gemini Flash 子智能体飞速完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A chat's heads show in the sidebar while one of them runs; the whole card leaves once every head of that chat has finished, and comes back on its own when one starts again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对话的子智能体在其中任何一个运行期间显示在侧边栏；该对话的子智能体全部完成后整张卡片会收起，有新的子智能体启动时再自动出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A custom binary path is set, so Tivano will not update it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已设置自定义可执行文件路径，因此 Tivano 不会更新它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A custom binary path is set, so Tivano will not update it. It still compares the installed version with the newest release every six hours." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已设置自定义可执行文件路径，因此 Tivano 不会更新它。仍会每六小时将已安装版本与最新发布版比较一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A file path must not contain a null character." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件路径不能包含空字符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A finished head hands its report to the lead, which checks the work and answers you. Cleared heads move from the panel to the sidebar." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成的子智能体会把报告交给主导模型，由主导模型检查工作并回复你。清除的子智能体会从面板移到侧边栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A finished head hands its report to the lead, which checks the work and answers you. Completed heads collapse automatically; their reports stay in completion cards in the chat." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "子智能体完成后将报告交给主导模型，由它检查工作并回复你。完成的子智能体会自动收起，工作报告保留在聊天里的完成卡片中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A finished head moves from the panel to the sidebar." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成的子智能体会从面板移到侧边栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A head gets a self-contained brief and its own panel beside the chat, on the model its pair names or the chat's own." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个子智能体会收到一份独立完整的任务简报，并在对话旁拥有自己的面板，使用其组合指定的模型或本对话的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A lead thinking above medium sends its heads out at medium on the same model — on a scale without a medium (Z.ai), at the scale's own middle rung; a pair that names the heads' effort keeps it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主导模型的推理强度高于“中”时，子智能体仍以同一模型的“中”强度运行；对于没有“中”档的强度范围（Z.ai），则取该范围的中间一档；组合中指定了子智能体强度的，保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A native home for your coding agents, built in Swift with Liquid Glass. A fork of Droppy Code by Jordy Spruit (Droppy)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为你的编程智能体打造的原生之家，使用 Swift 和 Liquid Glass 构建。基于 Jordy Spruit（Droppy）开发的 Droppy Code。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new thread follows the one you are in: its provider, model, effort and Hydra pair. With no thread open it starts on the provider you last chose." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新对话沿用当前对话的服务商、模型、推理强度和 Hydra 组合。未打开对话时，使用你上次选择的服务商。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pair can lead on one provider and run its heads on another." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "组合可以由一个服务商主导，并在另一个服务商上运行子智能体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pair says which model leads and which model, or which provider, runs the heads: Opus leading Sonnet, or Claude leading Gemini heads. Without one, the heads run on this chat's model at a working effort. Pairs live in the model picker and in Settings › Hydra." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "组合用于指定由哪个模型主导，以及由哪个模型或服务商运行子智能体：例如 Opus 主导 Sonnet，或 Claude 主导 Gemini 子智能体。未设置组合时，子智能体会以常规强度使用本对话的模型。组合可在模型选择器和“设置 › Hydra”中管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pair says which model leads and which runs the heads. Put a deep thinker over quick hands on one provider, or lead on one provider and send the heads out on another: the strongest lead with the fastest team, every time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "组合用来指定由哪个模型主导、哪个模型运行子智能体。你可以在同一服务商下让擅长深度思考的模型搭配动作迅速的模型，也可以让一个服务商主导、另一个服务商运行子智能体：每次都让最强的主导搭配最快的团队。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A panel each" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各自面板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A patch in %@ targets a missing or incompatible ACP row. Desktop-only overrides are not supported." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 中的补丁指向不存在或不兼容的 ACP 配置项。不支持仅适用于桌面端的覆盖配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A picture of your own behind the glass, mixed with the desktop by the transparency slider" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在玻璃效果后方放一张你自己的图片，并通过透明度滑块与桌面混合"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A prompt queued behind a running turn goes out at once." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "排在运行中轮次之后的提示词会立即发出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A search pattern must not contain a null character." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "搜索模式不能包含空字符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A server named “%@” already exists." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已存在名为“%@”的服务器。"
