    "A soft chime, whether or not the thread is in view" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无论是否正在查看该对话，都会播放轻柔的提示音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stdio server needs a command." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "stdio 服务器需要填写命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A teru teru bozu at the top of the sidebar keeps you company while agents work, and its weather shows how your threads are doing: it sways in the wind while they run, turns overcast when one needs you, brightens when a reply lands and rains when one fails. It animates only while visible." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "侧栏顶部挂着一只晴天娃娃，陪你等代理干活，也用天气提示对话状态：运行时随风摆动，等你处理时转阴，有新回复时放晴，出错时落雨。只在可见时才会动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AGPL-3.0 with attribution terms, and the notices for what the app builds on." : {
