          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dynamic plugin module names are not supported by read-only marketplace inheritance." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以只读方式继承市场配置时，不支持动态插件模块名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each head after the first gets a panel of its own beside the chat while there is room, left and right until each side is full." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "除第一个外，每个子智能体在空间允许时都会在对话旁获得独立面板，先左后右，直到两侧排满。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each head gets one brief and a panel of its own beside the chat, all working at the same time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个子智能体各领一份简报，在对话旁拥有自己的面板，并同时工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each head gets one brief and a panel of its own beside the chat, all working at the same time. Heads use the selected models to do their tasks, then return their reports to the lead chat." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个子智能体获得一份任务说明，并在聊天旁拥有独立面板，同时开展工作。子智能体使用所选模型执行任务，再把工作报告交回主会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each head gets one brief and a panel of its own beside the chat. Hank, Walter, Ada and the rest work at the same time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个子智能体各领一份简报，在对话旁拥有自己的面板。Hank、Walter、Ada 等同时工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each head works in a copy of its own; its changes land in the chat's checkout when it reports." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个子智能体在各自的副本中工作，汇报时其改动会合并回该对话的检出目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each one goes to a head as soon as there is room, instead of waiting for the lead." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条都会在有名额时立即交给子智能体，不必等待主智能体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
