    "Off: the team's changes stay in your working copy for you to handle. On: Tivano commits them, pushes to the remote, opens a pull or merge request and tries to merge it; needs a configured remote and access." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭时，团队的改动留在你的工作区，由你处理。开启时，Tivano 会提交改动、推送到远端、创建拉取 / 合并请求并尝试合并；需要已配置远端和相应权限。"
          }
