    "Talk with Codex out loud. Start a call from Start voice in the sidebar, or from the waveform button in any Codex chat to continue that chat by voice. Codex listens, answers and does the work in the chat. Needs Codex 0.159 or later, signed in with ChatGPT." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "直接用语音和 Codex 对话。可从侧边栏的“开始语音”发起通话，也可在任意 Codex 会话中点击波形按钮，用语音继续该会话。Codex 会倾听、回答，并在会话中完成工作。需要 Codex 0.159 或更高版本，并使用 ChatGPT 登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk with Codex out loud. Start a call from Start voice in the sidebar, or from the waveform button in any Codex chat to continue that chat by voice. Codex listens, answers and does the work in the chat. Needs Codex 0.159 or later, signed in with ChatGPT. Turning this off ends the current call." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与 Codex 语音交流。从侧边栏的“开始语音”发起通话，或点击任意 Codex 对话中的波形按钮，通过语音继续该对话。Codex 会聆听、回答，并在对话中完成工作。需要 Codex 0.159 或更高版本，并使用 ChatGPT 登录。关闭后会结束当前通话。"
          }
        }
      }
