          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tivano repaired damaged workspace records and kept all chats. Affected workspaces cannot run. The original file is kept at %@ and the damaged records at %@." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tivano 已修复损坏的工作区记录，所有会话均已保留。异常工作区已禁止执行。原文件保存在 %@，损坏的原始记录保存在 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tivano could not persist the local-control operation." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tivano 无法持久保存此本地控制操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tivano couldn't read %lld items in its library and loaded the rest. The original file is kept at %@ and the unreadable items at %@." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tivano 无法读取资料库中的 %lld 项，已加载其余内容。原文件保存在 %@，无法读取的项目保存在 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tivano couldn't read its library (%@). The original file and chat documents are preserved. Repair the library and restart Tivano. Any new chats will be saved separately to %@ when you quit." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tivano 无法读取资料库（%@）。原文件和会话文档已保留。请修复资料库后重启 Tivano。退出时，新建会话会另存至 %@。"
          }
