      }
    },
    "Tivano library" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tivano 资料库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tivano local control (the app must already be running and manually enabled in Settings > Alpha).\nCommands: info | providers | projects | threads | thread UUID | history UUID\n  create --workspace local|worktree --provider ID [--project UUID] [--model ID]\n  send UUID --text TEXT [--continuation automatic|fresh|providerSession|transcript]\n  send UUID --stdin [--continuation MODE]\n  interrupt UUID --turn UUID\n  operation INSTANCE/UUID/TIMESTAMP\n  settings get | settings set textGeneration automatic|claude|codex|off\n  settings set antiSlopEnabled|performanceMode|showsSkylight true|false\nList flags: --limit N --cursor TOKEN\nThread flags: --archive active|archived|all --role normal|helper|head|all\n  --affiliation all|standalone|project|missing_project [--project UUID] [--search TEXT]\nWrites: --operation INSTANCE/UUID/TIMESTAMP reuses an existing ticket in that instance only.\nSave the ticket printed before delivery. A disconnect is not failure; query the ticket instead of repeating the write.\nJSON output reports acceptance, not task success. Expired/restarted outcomes are unknown. No automatic retries or app launch." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tivano 本地控制（应用必须已运行，并在设置 > Alpha 中手动启用）。\n命令：info | providers | projects | threads | thread UUID | history UUID\n  create --workspace local|worktree --provider ID [--project UUID] [--model ID]\n  send UUID --text TEXT [--continuation automatic|fresh|providerSession|transcript]\n  send UUID --stdin [--continuation MODE]\n  interrupt UUID --turn UUID\n  operation INSTANCE/UUID/TIMESTAMP\n  settings get | settings set textGeneration automatic|claude|codex|off\n  settings set antiSlopEnabled|performanceMode|showsSkylight true|false\n列表选项：--limit N --cursor TOKEN\n线程选项：--archive active|archived|all --role normal|helper|head|all\n  --affiliation all|standalone|project|missing_project [--project UUID] [--search TEXT]\n写操作：--operation INSTANCE/UUID/TIMESTAMP 仅在同一应用实例中复用已有操作凭据。\n请保存发送前打印的操作凭据。断开连接不代表失败；应查询凭据，而非重复执行写操作。\nJSON 输出表示操作已接受，不代表任务成功。过期或重启后的结果为 unknown。不会自动重试或启动应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tivano uses the authentication route already selected in mcode. Token Plan uses your existing mcode sign-in; API-key users keep their configured key. Local checks and model lists do not verify server authentication." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tivano 沿用 mcode 已选择的认证路由：Token Plan 使用现有 mcode 登录态，API-key 路由使用已配置的密钥。本地检查和模型列表不代表服务端认证成功。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tivano uses your microphone only when you start a voice session. Your audio is sent to OpenAI through your own ChatGPT-signed-in Codex." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tivano 仅在你发起语音会话时使用麦克风。音频会通过你自己使用 ChatGPT 登录的 Codex 发送给 OpenAI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tivano will not replace or remove another command. Resolve the collision in ~/.local/bin and try again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tivano 不会替换或删除其他命令。请解决 ~/.local/bin 中的冲突后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tivano's library file was damaged, so it loaded the copy saved at the last launch. Chats created since then may be missing from the sidebar; their documents are still on disk. The damaged file is kept at %@." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tivano 的资料库文件已损坏，因此加载了上次启动时保存的副本。此后创建的会话可能不会出现在侧栏中，但会话文档仍保存在磁盘上。损坏的文件保存在 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
