          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While tasks run, your Mac won't doze off. Keep Mac awake lets the screen turn off on its own; Keep Mac and screen awake leaves it lit too, which helps when an agent needs to see a front end. Manual sleep and closing the lid still work." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任务运行期间，Mac 不会自己睡着。「保持唤醒」时屏幕仍会自行熄灭；「保持唤醒并亮屏」会让屏幕也一直亮着，适合 agent 需要盯着前端界面测试的时候。手动休眠和合盖仍然有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
