        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法删除构建文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete thread, keep worktree" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除对话，保留 worktree"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its history will be removed. Removing its worktree frees its space; its branch and commits stay, and a worktree with uncommitted changes is kept." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的历史记录将被移除。移除 worktree 可释放其占用的空间；分支和提交会保留，有未提交改动的 worktree 也会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this Mac" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chats, attachments and the worktrees Tivano made for your projects." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "聊天、附件，以及 Tivano 为你的项目创建的 worktree。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tivano uses %@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tivano 已占用 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measuring…" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在计算…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ of the worktrees is dependencies and build output, which can be deleted and rebuilt." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "worktree 中有 %@ 是依赖和构建产物，可以删除，需要时再重新生成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each worktree is a separate copy of a project, made so a chat can work without touching your checkout. Most of its space is usually dependencies and build output." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个 worktree 都是项目的一份独立副本，让聊天可以工作而不影响你的主目录。占用的空间大多来自依赖和构建产物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete the worktree \"%@\"?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除 worktree“%@”？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete worktree (%@)" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除 worktree（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The whole folder is deleted. Its branch and commits stay in the repository." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整个文件夹将被删除。它的分支和提交仍保留在仓库中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used by archived chat “%@”" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已归档的聊天“%@”在用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used by chat “%@”" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "聊天“%@”在用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leftover folder, not a worktree" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "残留文件夹，不是 worktree"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@, of which %@ build files" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@，其中构建文件 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A chat still uses it. Delete that chat to delete its worktree." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仍有聊天在使用它。删除那个聊天时可一并删除它的 worktree。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It has uncommitted changes. Commit or discard them first." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它有未提交的改动。请先提交或丢弃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is in use by a project." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它正被某个项目使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free up space…" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "释放空间…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete build files" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除构建文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deletes node_modules and other dependency and build folders. Your code and changes stay; the next install or build brings them back." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除 node_modules 等依赖和构建文件夹。你的代码和改动都不受影响，下次安装或构建时会重新生成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete worktree" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除 worktree"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deletes this whole copy. Its branch and commits stay in the repository." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除这整份副本。它的分支和提交仍保留在仓库中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chats you archive leave the sidebar and wait here. Nothing is archived yet." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "归档的聊天会从侧边栏移到这里。目前还没有归档的聊天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore a chat to the sidebar, or delete it for good. A chat's worktree can go with it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以把聊天恢复到侧边栏，或永久删除。删除时可一并删除它的 worktree。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worktree %@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "worktree %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow %@ to control Tivano?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许 %@ 控制 Tivano？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow full control" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许完全控制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow read only" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许只读访问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve on your Mac" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你的 Mac 上批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve or deny the requests already waiting in Tivano, then try again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先在 Tivano 中批准或拒绝等待中的请求，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Code %@. Check that it matches the page in your browser. It returns to %@. Full control can create threads and send messages; approvals and questions still wait for you in Tivano." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "验证码为 %@。请确认它与浏览器页面显示的一致。授权后将返回 %@。完全控制权限允许创建对话和发送消息；审批和问题仍需你在 Tivano 中处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connection request not valid" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接请求无效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy server URL" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "复制服务器 URL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disconnect all" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "断开所有连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter an HTTPS address. Plain HTTP works only for this Mac." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请输入 HTTPS 地址。HTTP 仅可用于本机访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Features here are early versions and may be unstable. Turning Alpha off ends the current voice call and disables local control and remote MCP. Individual feature choices are kept." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里的功能尚处早期，可能不稳定。关闭 Alpha 会结束当前语音通话，并停用本地控制和远程 MCP。各项功能的开关选择会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full control" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完全控制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last used %@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上次使用：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let cloud agents such as Muse or Grok Bot control this edition of Tivano over MCP, through a tunnel you run. Each agent needs your approval here once. Approvals and questions in threads still wait in Tivano." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许 Muse 或 Grok Bot 等云端代理通过你运行的隧道，以 MCP 控制当前版本的 Tivano。每个代理都需要先在这里获得你的批准。对话中的审批和问题仍需你在 Tivano 中处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listening on 127.0.0.1:%d" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
